      "reason": "by design: index_metadata_digest sorts by path, so reordering is harmless and must not be a vector"
    },
    {
      "attack": "delete the seal",
      "reason": "on the unsigned base this is S6 INCONCLUSIVE, not FAIL; it cannot be a FAIL vector. A sealed package that loses its seal cannot reach PASS"
    },
